    },
    {
      "text": "not a defensible methodology under",
      "start": 390.96,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "inspection. In another case, an engineer",
      "start": 392.72,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "manually tuned hyper-parameters, and",
      "start": 395.16,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "honestly, they might have even picked",
      "start": 397.36,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "the best ones. But, because there was no",
      "start": 398.72,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "documented search methodology or",
      "start": 400.8,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "rationale, an inspector challenged how",
      "start": 402.56,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "they knew alternative configurations",
      "start": 404.8,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "wouldn't perform better. The",
      "start": 406.68,
      "duration": 3.239
    },
    {
      "text": "documentation was deemed inadequate,",
      "start": 408.16,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "which led to a massive remediation",
      "start": 409.919,
      "duration": 3.241
    },
    {
      "text": "effort, where they had to completely",
      "start": 411.72,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "retune and revalidate the entire model.",
      "start": 413.16,
      "duration": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Here are a few more ways small",
      "start": 416.28,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "development gaps cascade into major",
      "start": 418.04,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "compliance disasters.",
      "start": 420.6,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "If you use cross-validation, but",
      "start": 422.56,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "accidentally contaminate your test data,",
      "start": 424.28,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "you end up with inflated validation",
      "start": 426.48,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "evidence and terrible operational",
      "start": 428.48,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "degradation.",
      "start": 430.32,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "If you detect bias late because you just",
      "start": 431.84,
      "duration": 3.24
    },
    {
      "text": "assumed your training data was",
      "start": 433.56,
      "duration": 3.6
    },
    {
      "text": "sufficiently representative, you might",
      "start": 435.08,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "have to suspend the model entirely and",
      "start": 437.16,
      "duration": 3.8
    },
    {
      "text": "re-evaluate thousands of historical",
      "start": 439.2,
      "duration": 3.12
    },
    {
      "text": "batch scores.",
      "start": 440.96,
      "duration": 2.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Or, if you skip calibration",
      "start": 442.32,
      "duration": 3.32
    },
    {
      "text": "verification, you can end up with an",
      "start": 443.84,
      "duration": 3.68
    },
    {
      "text": "overconfident AI that causes human",
      "start": 445.64,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "operators to place wildly inappropriate",
      "start": 447.52,
      "duration": 5.16
    },
    {
      "text": "trust in unsafe productions.",
      "start": 449.88,
      "duration": 5.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Section six, documentation and",
      "start": 452.68,
      "duration": 5.239
    },
    {
      "text": "inspection readiness.",
      "start": 455.8,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, what's really interesting here is",
      "start": 457.919,
      "duration": 4.921
    },
    {
      "text": "how we standardize all this evidence. We",
      "start": 460.16,
      "duration": 5.0
    },
    {
      "text": "use model cards. A model card summarizes",
      "start": 462.84,
      "duration": 4.68
    },
    {
      "text": "the AI artifact in a single standardized",
      "start": 465.16,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "format. And for an inspector, this is",
      "start": 467.52,
      "duration": 4.24
    },
    {
      "text": "pure gold. They can rapidly understand",
      "start": 469.68,
      "duration": 3.56
    },
    {
      "text": "the intended use, the training data",
      "start": 471.76,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "metadata, the performance metrics, and",
      "start": 473.24,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "crucially the limitations and known",
      "start": 475.48,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "biases. It proves to an auditor",
      "start": 476.96,
      "duration": 3.64
    },
    {
      "text": "immediately that you understand exactly",
      "start": 478.88,
      "duration": 3.44
    },
    {
      "text": "what your AI is designed to do, what its",
      "start": 480.6,
      "duration": 3.36
    },
    {
      "text": "boundaries are, and that you're actively",
      "start": 482.32,
      "duration": 3.2
    },
    {
      "text": "managing its risks.",
      "start": 483.96,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Ultimately, here is the inspector's",
      "start": 485.52,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "perspective on your development process.",
      "start": 487.24,
      "duration": 4.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Treat this as your practical everyday",
      "start": 489.52,
      "duration": 3.16
    },
    {
      "text": "checklist.",
      "start": 491.44,
      "duration": 2.52
    },
    {
      "text": "They want evidence of controlled",
      "start": 492.68,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "engineering, not ad hoc data science.",
      "start": 493.96,
      "duration": 4.52
    },
    {
      "text": "They expect coordinated version control",
      "start": 496.64,
      "duration": 4.56
    },
    {
      "text": "across data, code, and configuration.",
      "start": 498.48,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole shebang.",
      "start": 501.2,
      "duration": 2.16
    },
    {
      "text": "They want to see that your",
      "start": 502.52,
      "duration": 2.52
    },
    {
      "text": "reproducibility infrastructure is",
      "start": 503.36,
      "duration": 3.96
    },
    {
      "text": "actually exercised, not just claimed in",
      "start": 505.04,
      "duration": 4.32
    },
    {
      "text": "an SOP sitting on a shelf.",
      "start": 507.32,
      "duration": 3.28
    },
    {
      "text": "They're going to look for documented",
      "start": 509.36,
      "duration": 3.359
    },
    {
      "text": "hyperparameter searches and explicit",
      "start": 510.6,
      "duration": 3.879
    },
    {
      "text": "bias evaluations.",
      "start": 512.719,
      "duration": 3.721
    },
    {
      "text": "Strong, visible discipline here projects",
      "start": 514.479,
      "duration": 3.961
    },
    {
      "text": "engineering competence, and it severely",
      "start": 516.44,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "reduces an inspector's inclination to",
      "start": 518.44,
      "duration": 4.12
    },
    {
      "text": "keep digging deeper. Which brings us to",
      "start": 520.36,
      "duration": 4.0
    },
    {
      "text": "our final thought. Are your development",
      "start": 522.56,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "records robust enough to defend exactly",
      "start": 524.36,
      "duration": 4.64
    },
    {
      "text": "how your AI came to exist? If the answer",
      "start": 526.48,
      "duration": 4.48
    },
    {
      "text": "is no, then you simply aren't ready to",
      "start": 529.0,
      "duration": 4.16
    },
    {
      "text": "move into the validation phase. But, if",
      "start": 530.96,
      "duration": 3.4
    },
    {
      "text": "you implement the engineering",
      "start": 533.16,
      "duration": 3.08
    },
    {
      "text": "disciplines we've discussed today, if",
      "start": 534.36,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "you version meticulously, document your",
      "start": 536.24,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "parameters, and actively operationalize",
      "start": 538.28,
      "duration": 4.36
    },
    {
      "text": "your bias prevention, you are going to",
      "start": 540.6,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "build AI that isn't just accurate on a",
      "start": 542.64,
      "duration": 3.92
    },
    {
      "text": "benchmark, but truly trustworthy in the",
      "start": 544.44,
      "duration": 3.399
    },
    {
      "text": "real world.",
      "start": 546.56,
      "duration": 2.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about your own organization's",
      "start": 547.839,
      "duration": 3.441
    },
    {
      "text": "readiness today. Because next time we'll",
      "start": 549.2,
      "duration": 4.04
    },
    {
      "text": "be tackling exactly what comes next,",
      "start": 551.28,
      "duration": 3.72
    },
    {
      "text": "validation and performance testing in",
      "start": 553.24,
      "duration": 3.0
    },
    {
      "text": "module eight.",
      "start": 555.0,
      "duration": 2.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks so much for joining me and keep",
      "start": 556.24,
      "duration": 3.84
    },
    {
      "text": "learning.",
      "start": 557.68,
      "duration": 2.4
    }
  ]
}